WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Thank you. Thank you.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.536 align:start size:94% position:6%
That is the exact right amount
of applause.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:06.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
You would not believe how many
audiences get that wrong.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:11.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
I will not disappoint.
I am a feminist and a vegan.

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:12.712 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So -- Yeah.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, so you know my sense
of humor is top-shelf.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.518 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Any vegans...?

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.588
I don't believe none here.
Maybe too tired to clap.

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have your lentils
early in the day.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.960 line:92%
You know, you lose some steam.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love it.
I love being a vegan.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's no animal
or animal byproduct of any k--

00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:35.435 size:81% position:41%
I do eat eggs, because
I'm also pro-choice.

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.407 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:43.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't like people
who are too extreme.

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:46.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
"I'm a vegan, but I hunt."

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.680 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.816
My friends are like, "Oh,
my God. That's so hypocritical."

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:53.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
"But I don't eat any of it.
I just leave it there.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't use any part
of the animal.

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:59.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
So...still holding strong
to my beliefs."

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:00.627 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm a feminist.

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:03.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do we have any feminists here
tonight, by applause?

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.931 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.833 line:92%
Wow! A lot of single ladies.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.435 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:12.238
No, it's -- it's so hard if
you're on a date to be like,

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:14.107 line:92%
"Whoo! The future is female!

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you still gonna
pay for everything?

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.646 line:92%
Is that deal still on the table?

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:21.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm more of a feminist
in the mornings

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.918 size:75% position:38%
when nobody's trying
to buy me anything."

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, ladies,
maybe we should start paying

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:29.422
for our own dinner and drinks,
you know, really let guys know

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're serious about
this equality thing.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:34.527 align:start size:94% position:6%
Really --
I'm just kidding around.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.162 line:92%
Why would we do that? No.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:40.033
I think it's the responsibility
of a man you just met online

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.468 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to feed you.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.969 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.638 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's got the option
to kill you later,

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.113 line:92%
so I feel like that's fair.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:57.617
You put in all the risk.
Get a nice meal out of it.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love the whole
#MeToo Movement.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just think it's so --
I am lucky.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:04.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never had any
sexual harassment happen.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.160 line:92%
I tried to start #MeNeither.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:12.365
It's never caught on.
You know, I had nobody join up.

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:13.600 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:17.237
The greatest thing about
being a woman is I'm a mom.

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:20.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I had a baby.
I'll never forget it.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.909 line:92%
It was five or ten years ago.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.245 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.747 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:30.316 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
When my daughter turned 10,
I got her a phone.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:35.588
And she's always on it.
She just loves her phone.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.457 size:81% position:41%
I don't even know what
she looks like without

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
a light in her face.
I'll be honest with you.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
The other day,
she was reading a book.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:43.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
I walked right by.
I didn't know who she was.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:47.467 size:88% position:44%
I was like, "Who is that
with the sepia tones?"

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:48.501 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:52.238
It's so bad for your kids.
They say it's digital heroin.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:54.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, when I heard that,
I got scared.

00:02:54.107 --> 00:02:56.643 size:81% position:41%
I told my daughter --
I tweeted it to her --

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:58.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"Hey, this has got to stop!"

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:01.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then she favorited it,
and then we Snapchatted

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:04.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
back and forth about it
a little bit.

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.052 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't remember
those conversations.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we'll never
have them back, but...

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:11.624 line:92%
that is the nature of Snapchat.

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:12.292 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Parenting is hard.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.794
You have to teach your kids
stuff that you just think

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
they should already
instinctively know.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.698 size:78% position:39%
Like, the other day,
my daughter and I are

00:03:18.698 --> 00:03:20.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
going through the drive-thru
at Dunkin' Donuts.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go to her,
"Hey, you want a doughnut?"

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:24.504
She goes, "Oh, I'm not
really hungry right now."

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:29.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like, "That's not
how doughnuts work.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:31.678
What, are you gonna wait
until your stomach growls?

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.247 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nobody does that!
This is America.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:36.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
You eat until your heart
gives out."

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:40.386 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:46.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
I punished my daughter
a few weeks ago.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:48.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
I took her phone away
for three days

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:52.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
because she was
being mean to Siri.

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:56.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the transformation in her
was unbelievable.

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:59.606
Like, yes, the first day, she
just laid on the floor crying,

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:03.309 size:78% position:39%
but once she got over
the shakes, she...

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:04.344 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:05.578 line:92%
She got up, she looked around,

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
she started liking things
in real life.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.817 line:92%
She double-tapped the dog.

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:12.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:14.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was like,
"Mom, let's go to the park.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:17.323
Mom, let's go to the library.
Mom, let's play in the creek."

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:20.193 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I just gave her
her phone back.

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:22.028 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:24.297 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.701 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So, I'm married,

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:31.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this is the sadder part
of the show.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.072 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:35.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wish somebody had told me
before I got married

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:38.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
how much yelling I would
have to do on a daily basis.

00:04:38.411 --> 00:04:40.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's really
an incredible amount of --

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.782
If you're not married yet,
start yelling at your boyfriend.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:45.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
You've got to build
those vocal cords up.

00:04:45.652 --> 00:04:47.787 size:81% position:41%
Because in marriage,
there's no better way.

00:04:47.787 --> 00:04:50.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, at one point,
I got so mad at my husband,

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:52.492
I gave him the silent treatment
for a week.

00:04:52.492 --> 00:04:53.393 line:92%
At the end of it, he was like,

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:56.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
"We've been getting along
pretty good lately."

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:58.564 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:58.564 --> 00:05:01.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much!
Thank you.

00:05:01.668 --> 00:05:03.703 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:05:03.703 --> 00:05:06.906 size:88% position:44%
-That couldn't have gone
any better. I love you.

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:10.243 line:92%
Bonnie! Bonnie McFarlane!

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:13.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
Follow her on Twitter --
@BonnieMcFarlane.

